      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nFunctional Requirements : \n\n1.  Search something like youtube:\n2. text -> matching with title of youtube videos ?? -> fuzzy -> title + tag + description.\n3.  sorting -> chronological. \n4.  Prefix suggestion -> goole , of yts videos -> 10\n\n// out of scope. \n1. filter sorting.\n2. ML -> out of scope.   \n\n\nNon functional Reqruiments : \n\n1.  Availabitliy >> consistency. -> fussy -> CAP.\n\n\n\nEstimations: \n1.  Scale:  -> 100M daily ->  1000 qps\n2. Storage -> \n3. Peak -> 2x -> 2000 qps.\n4. Prefix -> limit -> upto some prefix ?? -> 10 size. \n\n\n\nEntites:   \nMetadata of videos -> videoMetadata , \n\n\nApi Design: \n\n1. GET /api/v1/prefixsearch/?query=\"\"\n\nReponse: [\"\", \"\", \"\"] -> status code .\n\n2. GET /api/v1/videosearch/?query=\"\"&from=\"\"&size=\"\"\n\nPagination\n\nReponse: {\n   paginatedDetail: { totalCounts, from , size }\n   hits: [\n      { VideoMeta, }\n   ]\n\n}\n\n\nHigh Level Design: \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20.58781420417981,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nFunctional Requirements : \n\n1.  Search something like youtube:\n2. text -> matching with title of youtube videos ?? -> fuzzy -> title + tag + description.\n3.  sorting -> chronological. \n4.  Prefix suggestion -> goole , of yts videos -> 10\n\n// out of scope. \n1. filter sorting.\n2. ML -> out of scope.   \n\n\nNon functional Reqruiments : \n\n1.  Availabitliy >> consistency. -> fussy -> CAP.\n\n\n\nEstimations: \n1.  Scale:  -> 100M daily ->  1000 qps\n2. Storage -> \n3. Peak -> 2x -> 2000 qps.\n4. Prefix -> limit -> upto some prefix ?? -> 10 size. \n\n\n\nEntites:   \nMetadata of videos -> videoMetadata , \n\n\nApi Design: \n\n1. GET /api/v1/prefixsearch/?query=\"\"\n\nReponse: [\"\", \"\", \"\"] -> status code .\n\n2. GET /api/v1/videosearch/?query=\"\"&from=\"\"&size=\"\"\n\nPagination\n\nReponse: {\n   paginatedDetail: { totalCounts, from , size }\n   hits: [\n      { VideoMeta, }\n   ]\n\n}\n\n\nHigh Level Design: \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
